---
layout: default
title: Series
description: "Multi-part posts on rdjarbeng.com, collected so you can read them in order."
permalink: /series/
---
<h1>Series</h1>
<p>Longer topics split into parts. Each series is best read from Part 1.</p>

<ul class="series-index">
  {% for s in collections.seriesList %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.name }}</a>
    <span class="series-index__count">{{ s.parts | size }} parts</span>
    {% if s.description %}<p>{{ s.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
